    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 691354648055808
    m_Localized: to grab & cleaning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 691615315660800
    m_Localized: to rotate artifact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692064299126784
    m_Localized: Wrap Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692417103007744
    m_Localized: ~ Restoration Complete ~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693192948584448
    m_Localized: Paused
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693439103897600
    m_Localized: Resume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693643894984704
    m_Localized: Back to Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694035294851072
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to exit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694091263643648
    m_Localized: You progress will not be saved and the game starts  from the beginning
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698589835038720
    m_Localized: Unboxing Artefact...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698550941257728
    m_Localized: Returning to Menu...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698510105513984
    m_Localized: Displaying Artefact...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 720976676786176
    m_Localized: Drag artefact to the center for inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 721210291130368
    m_Localized: Use the mouse wheel to Zoom in/out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 721439744724992
    m_Localized: Hold right click and rotate the mouse around to rotate the Coin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 721534246588416
    m_Localized: Select the brush, then hold and drag across the artifact to clean
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 721780603228160
    m_Localized: Select the chisel, then tap the dirt repeatedly to remove it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 721970382901248
    m_Localized: Press "Tab" to find the remaining dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 722153502019584
    m_Localized: Press "Tab" to find the remaining dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 722369328320512
    m_Localized: "Nice work. The artifact is ready for display in the museum.\nYou
      can tap Wrap Up in the bottom-right to finish, or keep restoring until it\u2019s
      perfect."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2027892690116608
    m_Localized: You can assemble all the pieces by dragging the correct part to
      the current inspected artifact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2027892694310912
    m_Localized: You can detach the part by hold the left button to the part. but
      you need to return your tool first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
